{"abstract":[{"code":"ViewModifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to manage an edge case about Liquid Glass configuration of Apple OS and Xcode versions.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"title":"MISOLegacyLayoutModifier","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOLegacyLayoutModifier","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct","externalID":"s:14MISOComponents24MISOLegacyLayoutModifierV","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOLegacyLayoutModifier"}]},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLegacyLayoutModifier\/init()"],"title":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLegacyLayoutModifier\/body(content:)"],"title":"Instance Methods"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLegacyLayoutModifier\/ViewModifier-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP"],"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misolegacylayoutmodifier"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOLegacyLayoutModifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 27 for iOS 27, Liquid Glass is forced by the system and considered as enabled by MISO."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 26 for iOS 26, the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" flag is read and MISO considers wether or not Liquid Glass is enabled."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 26 for iOS 18 and lower, Liquid Glass is considered as unavailable, disabled."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The edge case is when the OS version is 27, the flag "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" stils exists but the app is compiled with Xcode 26."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This case is extreme: the system does not force Liquid Glass, the flag is here, and MISO cannot only rely on the OS version."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Thus, this "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLegacyLayoutModifier","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"  will define an environment value saying any legacy layout things (appearances, selector, divider) must be displayed."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"**You must use this "},{"code":"ViewModifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with care, and only if you are using Xcode 26 and  "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" to YES **."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Prefer build with Xcode 27 without the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":"  flag."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["  MISOTabBar(selectedTab: ..., count: ...) { ... )","    .modifier(MISOLegacyLayoutModifier())"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note: You should use this view modifier in your root view because the flag it defines in deeper levels is used for all navigations components like bars"}],"type":"strong"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS 3.0.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Since","style":"note","type":"aside"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLegacyLayoutModifier"},"references":{"doc://MISOComponents/s8SendableP":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","title":"Swift.Sendable"},"doc://MISOComponents/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP","title":"SwiftUICore.ViewModifier"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOLegacyLayoutModifier/init()":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misolegacylayoutmodifier\/init()","title":"init()","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLegacyLayoutModifier\/init()","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Instanciates the ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOLegacyLayoutModifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and displays error messages in the standard output"}]},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOLegacyLayoutModifier/body(content:)":{"role":"symbol","title":"body(content:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLegacyLayoutModifier\/body(content:)","f